[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10380.95, "timestamp": "02:53:00", "text": "これは、厚みのある小さな掃除道具の冒険です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10383.03, "timestamp": "02:53:03", "text": "よし。えっと、ジョー、あなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10385.11, "timestamp": "02:53:05", "text": "私たちと一緒にステップアップしませんか？そして私は行くべきでしょうか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10387.59, "timestamp": "02:53:07", "text": "まず、かな？誰が彼女に会いたい？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10388.79, "timestamp": "02:53:08", "text": "お尻？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10390.15, "timestamp": "02:53:10", "text": "私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10393.11, "timestamp": "02:53:13", "text": "息子を帰らせてください。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10400.55, "timestamp": "02:53:20", "text": "よし。うん、うん、入ってみるよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10402.23, "timestamp": "02:53:22", "text": "初め。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10403.51, "timestamp": "02:53:23", "text": "わかった。私もこれをロールするつもりです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10405.11, "timestamp": "02:53:25", "text": "今。はい、どうぞ。転がすだけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10407.269, "timestamp": "02:53:27", "text": "それと、うん。わかった。わかった。かつてあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10409.269, "timestamp": "02:53:29", "text": "あちらに足を踏み入れるのが好きだと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10411.269, "timestamp": "02:53:31", "text": "ここであなたは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10413.429, "timestamp": "02:53:33", "text": "それを好きになるには、かなり遠くまで引き寄せる必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10414.95, "timestamp": "02:53:34", "text": "時間。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10416.79, "timestamp": "02:53:36", "text": "わかった。そして、そう。そして、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10418.389, "timestamp": "02:53:38", "text": "アリアナの番だ。よし。次は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10420.15, "timestamp": "02:53:40", "text": "町に戻るつもりだ。では次は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10421.59, "timestamp": "02:53:41", "text": "次は削除すべきです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10423.429, "timestamp": "02:53:43", "text": "そして、ステファンがここに足を踏み入れたら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10425.19, "timestamp": "02:53:45", "text": "引っ張られるのも好きです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10426.309, "timestamp": "02:53:46", "text": "おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10429.91, "timestamp": "02:53:49", "text": "待って。私は何をしますか？そこに留まるように。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10431.59, "timestamp": "02:53:51", "text": "引っ張られて、クリスは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10433.03, "timestamp": "02:53:53", "text": "私の髪を掴んだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10435.03, "timestamp": "02:53:55", "text": "しかし、そこに足を踏み入れると、引き込まれてしまう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10436.87, "timestamp": "02:53:56", "text": "で。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10437.67, "timestamp": "02:53:57", "text": "おお"}]